{"id":"6067389cc689812f","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-knot-concordance.md","title":"Knot Concordance","display":"df-knot-concordance — Knot Concordance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-knot-concordance","aliases":["58-df-knot-concordance"],"display":"df-knot-concordance — Knot Concordance","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-knot-concordance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-knot-concordance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-knot-concordance — Knot Concordance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-knot.md\">../batch05/58-df-knot.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"890a8458fc69d8c7\" href=\"?note=890a8458fc69d8c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,J\\in V\">\\(K,J\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Knot}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Knot}_S\\)</span> (classical-knot predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-knot.md\">../batch05/58-df-knot.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\)</span> (smooth-map predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (topological-embedding predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"890a8458fc69d8c7\" href=\"?note=890a8458fc69d8c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\)</span> (explicit product-topology predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothProperEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothProperEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (smooth proper-embedding predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Concordant}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Concordant}_S\\)</span> (smooth knot-concordance predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(2)\">\\(S^1=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(2)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(4)\">\\(S^3=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(4)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^1}\">\\(\\tau_{S^1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^3}\">\\(\\tau_{S^3}\\)</span> 为相应欧氏子空间拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\)</span>。积载体均为有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}proper\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothProperEmbedding}_S(F,A,\\tau_A,B,\\tau_B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S(F,A,\\tau_A,B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall C\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(C,\\{U\\cap C\\mid U\\in\\tau_B\\})\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(F^{-1}[C],\\{U\\cap F^{-1}[C]\\mid U\\in\\tau_A\\})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}proper\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothProperEmbedding}_S(F,A,\\tau_A,B,\\tau_B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S(F,A,\\tau_A,B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall C\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(C,\\{U\\cap C\\mid U\\in\\tau_B\\})\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(F^{-1}[C],\\{U\\cap F^{-1}[C]\\mid U\\in\\tau_A\\})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}concordance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Concordant}_S(K,J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(K)\\land\\operatorname{Knot}_S(J)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists F,\\tau_A,\\tau_B,\\vec X_A,\\vec\\tau_A,\\vec X_B,\\vec\\tau_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec X_A=\\{\\langle0,S^1\\rangle,\\langle1,[0,1]\\rangle\\}\n\\land\\vec\\tau_A=\\{\\langle0,\\tau_{S^1}\\rangle,\\langle1,\\tau_{[0,1]}\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\\tau_A=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(S^1,\\tau_{S^1},[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\\vec X_B=\\{\\langle0,S^3\\rangle,\\langle1,[0,1]\\rangle\\}\n\\land\\vec\\tau_B=\\{\\langle0,\\tau_{S^3}\\rangle,\\langle1,\\tau_{[0,1]}\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\\tau_B=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(S^3,\\tau_{S^3},[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothProperEmbedding}_S(F,S^1\\times[0,1],\\tau_A,S^3\\times[0,1],\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{29mm}\\land F[S^1\\times\\{0\\}]=K[S^1]\\times\\{0\\}\n\\land F[S^1\\times\\{1\\}]=J[S^1]\\times\\{1\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}concordance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Concordant}_S(K,J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(K)\\land\\operatorname{Knot}_S(J)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists F,\\tau_A,\\tau_B,\\vec X_A,\\vec\\tau_A,\\vec X_B,\\vec\\tau_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec X_A=\\{\\langle0,S^1\\rangle,\\langle1,[0,1]\\rangle\\}\n\\land\\vec\\tau_A=\\{\\langle0,\\tau_{S^1}\\rangle,\\langle1,\\tau_{[0,1]}\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\\tau_A=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(S^1,\\tau_{S^1},[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\\vec X_B=\\{\\langle0,S^3\\rangle,\\langle1,[0,1]\\rangle\\}\n\\land\\vec\\tau_B=\\{\\langle0,\\tau_{S^3}\\rangle,\\langle1,\\tau_{[0,1]}\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\\tau_B=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(S^3,\\tau_{S^3},[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothProperEmbedding}_S(F,S^1\\times[0,1],\\tau_A,S^3\\times[0,1],\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{29mm}\\land F[S^1\\times\\{0\\}]=K[S^1]\\times\\{0\\}\n\\land F[S^1\\times\\{1\\}]=J[S^1]\\times\\{1\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Smoothness, topological embeddedness, properness, and the two product topologies are separately exposed; a Cartesian product of topology sets is no longer mistaken for the generated product topology.</li>\n<li>For a slice knot, the Alexander polynomial satisfies the Fox–Milnor factorization constraint; it need not be trivial.</li>\n<li>Signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(K)\">\\(\\sigma(K)\\)</span> gives lower bound on slice genus.</li>\n<li>Metabolizer theory in 2-bridge knots.</li>\n<li>Concordance classes form an abelian group under connected sum; this is downstream from the equivalence relation defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-knot.md","status":"resolved","id":"ccaaf599ec318a33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"890a8458fc69d8c7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","embed":f